{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16208821","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16208821","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1620882101:1":{"text":"ま、魔物！？一体、どうして……","source_cn":"魔、魔物？！我不明白……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6826BDC409EF826","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620882102:1":{"text":"だってこれは、あたしたちが力を手に入れるための儀式だって言ってたはずじゃ……なのに、どうして魔物が？","source_cn":"您不是说，仪式是用来帮助我们获取更强的力量的吗？为什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2789754AAA1D99A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620882103:1":{"text":"ふむ……では、この世で最も強力な力は、誰が握っていると思う？","source_cn":"告诉我，这世界上最强大的力量，是由谁来掌控的呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FC3A00059762379","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1620882104:1":{"text":"神様、ですか……？","source_cn":"神……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AF67B9E456BFFD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620882105:1":{"text":"いいや。ソレは、私や君では到底理解できない存在だよ。","source_cn":"不，不是神。那是你我都无法理解的存在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF68FB555EAD1F39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1620882106:1":{"text":"だが神は、確かに強い。そして君が望む魔力など、神にとっては塵芥も同然だ。","source_cn":"但你说得不错，神的确很强大。你所渴慕、所向往的魔力，不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08D95CE3D6B41C7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1620882107:1":{"text":"故に、その差を補うには、神……もしくは神に近しい存在から奪うしかない。","source_cn":"若想要弥补己身的缺陷与瑕疵，需得从神……或是与神相似的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x142FC92B95CBF27E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1620882108:1":{"text":"その存在というのは……","source_cn":"老师，您指的究竟是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4049EFC4267C21D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1620882109:1":{"text":"カタストロフだよ。","source_cn":"恶魔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DEC7B052DB152DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1620882110:1":{"text":"神に酷似する彼らは、我々の想像をはるかに超える強大な力を持っている。神が与えられるものは、カタストロフにも与えられるのだよ。","source_cn":"那是与神相似的存在。它拥有着你无法想象的强大力量，神能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD94F0C2C49216B6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1620882111:1":{"text":"我々はその力を望んでいる。だから秘密裏に集まり、研究を重ね……そしてついに、この摩訶不思議で偉大な魔法を手にしたのだ。","source_cn":"我们渴慕这种力量，于是秘密结社，进行研究。我们成功了—...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9777ECA3ED89E28E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1620882112:1":{"text":"それが、先生の見せてくれた……あの魔法……？","source_cn":"是您向我展示的……那种魔法……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5722158C69465B37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1620882113:1":{"text":"ああ。それがあれば、我々はカタストロフや魔物から力を得ることができる。","source_cn":"没错。这就是我们从恶魔与魔物身上获得的力量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85E036CC5603F745","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1620882114:1":{"text":"神がこぼしたわずかな「滓」を、今かと待ち続けるのではなく……これは、<style=\"highlight\">自分の手で奪い取れる</style>力だ。","source_cn":"不像普通的魔力，你只能被动地等待，将神抛下的一点渣滓视...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED844CD552979EFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1620882115:1":{"text":"君が望めば、その力で世界最強のウィザードになれる。伝説の冒険者よりも百倍、いや千倍も強い力を手にできるのだ！","source_cn":"只要你想，就能凭借它成为世间最强的魔法师，甚至比那些所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BB894AA2FD2B562","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1620882116:1":{"text":"……そんな……そんなチャンスを、逃しちゃったなんて……！","source_cn":"……可恶……这样的事情……我竟然错过了！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09A6BF3ACF35F417","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1620882117:1":{"text":"強い力を手にできるチャンスだったのに、あたしは――","source_cn":"我竟然错过了获得如此强大力量的机会，我——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE645A714895B4F02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1620882118:1":{"text":"ははっ……焦ることはない。儀式はまだ終わってないからね。","source_cn":"呵呵……不要心急，你还有机会。仪式还没有结束。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8495A54CE04D63F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1620882119:1":{"text":"魔物の召喚は始まりにすぎない。我々の目的は……<style=\"highlight\">本物のカタストロフ</style>を呼び出すことだ！","source_cn":"召唤出魔物只是开始。这一次，我们的目标……是召唤出一只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6A89BCB6F32A767","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1620882120:1":{"text":"そして、<style=\"highlight\">そいつの力を奪い</style>、黒魔術を完全にものにしてみせる！","source_cn":"我们将<style=highlight>夺取它的能力<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26DF80A9FAAE9175","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:萨洛米":{"text":"サロミーヌ","source":"萨洛米","status":"matched_dialo